  "description": "SAXHUV crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C128 H144 O10 Se18 Sm8,3.25(C4 H8 O1). From the CIF bond table, Sm1 (Sm) has 1 O neighbors; Sm2 (Sm) has 2 O neighbors; Sm3 (Sm) has 2 O neighbors; Sm4 (Sm) has 2 O neighbors; Sm1B (Sm) has 1 O neighbors; Sm2B (Sm) has 2 O neighbors; Sm3B (Sm) has 2 O neighbors; Sm4B (Sm) has 2 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 4 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.772-3.883 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 116.48-124.54°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C128H144O10Se18Sm8·3.25(C4H8O).",
